# Brand Kit collection profiles

**Collection** (UI) = `BargainingUnit` (code). Brand Kit profiles are *comms identities* (local number + sub-text + optional code), not Hub tenancy. A steward can speak for more than one workplace without changing colours or logo.

Companion research: [`docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-08-17-brand-kit-collections.md`](../../docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-08-17-brand-kit-collections.md).

## Product rules

1. **Preset starter lists ship in** [`collection-profile-catalog.ts`](../../src/lib/brand/collection-profile-catalog.ts). Each list ends with **Other** so stewards rename/remove rows they do not use.
2. **Fresh Brand Kit / `other` preset:** one **Local** profile until a union preset is chosen.
3. **OPSEU preset:** **College Support Full-time** (`ft`) + **College Support Part-time** (`pt`) — CAAT Support reference tenant only.
4. **Applying a preset replaces profiles.** Switching presets must not leave the prior union’s collection labels behind.
5. **Saved kits are not rewritten on hydrate** except via `normalizeBrandKit` when `profiles` is missing — then preset catalog applies.
6. **Reference URLs** in the catalog are **general union homepages** for agent/docs context — never stored in Brand Kit or membership URLs.
7. **No union names in generic chrome.** Copy talks about collections, workplaces, or units.

